iptive statistics underestimate extremes of epidemic curve ensembles","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-091.86-037347","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"author_count":2,"contributors":["Lehmann, Sune","Juul, Jonas L."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-362981"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Cornell University"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the rules of contagion why things spread and why they stop by adam kucharski","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"djb","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-362981","identifier":[{"id":"000684080100002","type":"wos"}],"ids":["dtu-c35fc238-d1ab-4b23-9e7d-96a987b2540c"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-3A00FD36BE5753E4B05B23A9BE3BADA2"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Cognitive Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"cornell university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Cornell University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sune","key":"lehmannpau","last":"Lehmann","locid":"9049a0bd-7e6f-4f06-80f6-88ac447289e7","name":"Lehmann, Sune","orcid":"0000-0001-6099-2345","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas L.","key":"juulpau","last":"Juul","name":"Juul, Jonas L.","rank":2,"rolecode":"p