{"abstract":"Leg er børns naturlige måde at lære på, og vi er i denne artikel nysgerrige på, hvordan vi skaber mulighed for, at eleverne i matematikundervisningen kan styrke deres sociale og faglige kompetencer gennem en legende tilgang til undervisningen.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Müller, Mads Brink","Hansen, Jonas Juul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-391615"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Læring pædagogik og undervisning"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"legende tilgange i matematikundervisning er det en leg","src":["kp"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-391615","ids":["kp-c78d1dcf-7fa7-46ef-b3d6-d5d1904c4e5f"],"keyword":["Læring, pædagogik og undervisning"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EDC9E643DFD8D118BAC5E1426DAB0E06"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for læreruddannelse og livslang læring - Dekan, CFU Projekter og Laboratorier"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads Brink","key":"müllerpau","last":"Müller","locid":"4dc5e230-a518-45ba-8b6e-9504d9d628a1","name":"Müller, Mads Brink","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas Juul","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"869fff1a-19d9-4da5-86c2-ca41f1ce3968","name":"Hansen, Jonas Juul","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["0109937X"],"issue":"3","journal":"Matematik","pages":"22-26","publisher":"Danmarks Matematiklærerforening","status":"p","title":"Matematik","volume":"49"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kp-c78d1dcf-7fa7-46ef-b3d6-d5d1904c4e5f"],"src":["KP University College Copenhagen"],"title":"Legende tilgange i matematikundervisning - er det en leg?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-391615","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
