{"abstract":"Extracorporeal shockwave therapy (ESWT) is a novel treatment modality to stimulate tissue regeneration and anti-fibrosis. In this review, we summarise the use of ESWT for erectile dysfunction (ED), diabetic foot ulcers (DFU), Peyronie’s disease (PD), chronic kidney disease (CKD), and scleroderma. Several randomised clinical trials demonstrate the efficacy of ESWT for vasculogenic ED and DFU, and ESWT may also relieve pain in patients with PD. ESWT is still experimental for CKD and scleroderma. In general, ESWT is associated with few and mild adverse effects.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Møller Jeppesen, Sune","Lundrup, Ronja Niemann","Juul Ladegaard, Peter Bill","Mortensen, Jonas","Sørensen, Mia Dahl","Lund, Lars"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-577499"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"indikationer og anvendelse af ekstrakorporal shockbølgeterapi","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/indikationer-og-anvendelse-af-ekstrakorporal-shockbolgeterapi","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-577499","ids":["sdu-0f14e296-ca3a-4ff4-9c74-a14af4c0fafa"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-64153FE211AEE7D514AF36B72B6641E4"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of