{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Juul, Jonas S.","Krishna, Sandeep","Jensen, Mogens Høgh"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-532214"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"entrainment as a means of controlling phase waves in populations of coupled oscillators","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-532214","identifier":[{"id":"85059433867","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000454175900010","type":"wos"}],"ids":["ku-e86242cd-e268-443e-b13e-b8d4e917430d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DF4F1A896038663E5DCB1AD14005F6F6"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Niels Bohr Institute, Biocomplexity"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jonas S.","key":"juulpau","last":"Juul","locid":"4298e83e-ac49-4e04-9ea8-f26559478f2b","name":"Juul, Jonas S.","orcid":"0000-0002-5728-9269","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sandeep","key":"krishnapau","last":"Krishna","name":"Krishna, Sandeep","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mogens H.","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"f4659253-af0d-4000-89ad-02d2d33ceea7","name":"Jensen, Mogens Høgh","name_org":"Jensen, Mogens H.","orcid":"0000-0001-8104-4299","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1103/physreve.98.062412","issn":["24700045","24700053"],"issn_org":["24700045"],"issue":"6","journal":"Physical Review E","paperid":"062412","status":"p","title":"Physical Review E","volume":"98"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85059433867"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-e86242cd-e268-443e-b13e-b8d4e917430d"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Entrainment as a means of controlling phase waves in populations of coupled oscillators","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-532214","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: The inter-relationships of atrial fibrillation (AF) to retinal vascular occlusions (whether retinal artery occlusion (RAO) or retinal venous occlusion (RVO)) remain unclear. It is unknown if a presentation of retinal artery or venous occlusions may indicate a new onset cardiac arrhythmia. To shed light on this association, we investigated the risk of new onset AF in patients with known RAO and RVO. METHODS: Patients with retinal occlusions from 1997 to 2011 were identified through Danish nationwide registries and matched 1:5 according to sex and age. Cumulative incidence and unadjusted rates of AF according to retinal vascular occlusions (i.e. RAO or RVO) were determined. Hazard ratios (HR) of AF according to retinal vascular occlusion were adjusted for hypertension, diabetes, vascular disease and prior stroke/systemic thromboembolism/transient ischemic attack. RESULTS: One thousand three hundred sixty-eight cases with retinal vascular occlusions were identified (median age 71.4 (inter quartile range (IQR); 61.2-79.8), 47.3% male). RAO constituted 706 cases (51.6%) and RVO 529 (38.7%). The rate of incident AF amongst all cases with retinal vascular occlusion was 1.74 per 100 person-years (95% confidence interval (CI), 1.47-2.06) compared to 1.22 (95% CI, 1.12-1.33) in the matched control group. The rate of AF in RAO was 2.01 (95% CI, 1.6-2.52) and 1.52 (1.15-2.01) in RVO. HRs of incident AF adjusted for cardiovascular comorbidities were 1.26 (95% CI; 1.04-1.53, p = 0.019) for any retinal vascular occlusion, 1.45 (95% CI; 1.10-1.89, p = 0.015) for RAO, and 1.02 (95% CI; 0.74-1.39, p = 0.920) for RVO. CONCLUSIONS: A new diagnosis of retinal vascular occlusion in patients without prior AF was associated with increased risk of incident AF, particularly amongst patients with RAO. Awareness of AF in patients with retinal vascular occlusions is advised.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Christiansen, Christine Benn","Torp-Pedersen, Christian","Olesen, Jonas Bjerring","Gislason, Gunnar","Lamberts, Morten","Carlson, Nicholas","Buron, Mathias","Juul, Nikolai","Lip, Gregory Y H"],"cuid":["S03-099.98-011815"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Christiansen, Christine Benn"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","City Hospital in Birmingham","University of Birmingham"],"keyword":["Aged","Atrial Fibrillation diagnosis","Atrial fibrillation","Case Control Studies","Denmark epidemiology","Epidemiology","Female","Humans","Incidence","Male","Middle Aged","Registries","Retinal Artery Occlusion diagnosis","Retinal Vein Occlusion diagnosis","Retinal artery occlusion","Retinal vein occlusion","Risk Assessment","Risk Factors"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-HJER"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-NP-HJER","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"risk of incident atrial fibrillation in patients presenting with retinal artery or vein occlusion a nationwide cohort study","src":["aau","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12872-018-0825-1","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-099.98-011815","identifier":[{"id":"85046669933","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29743025","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC5944106","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"000432201800001","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-f7532644-95f7-4e9e-8003-f19dcaf69c82","ku-97e15c75-7e7c-4227-a904-881f64f7a210","sdu-d992482b-22a4-45a8-8803-785057146e51"],"keyword":["Aged","Atrial Fibrillation/diagnosis","Atrial fibrillation","Case-Control Studies","Denmark/epidemiology","Epidemiology","Female","Humans","Incidence","Male","Middle Aged","Registries","Retinal Artery Occlusion/diagnosis","Retinal Vein Occlusion/diagnosis","Retinal artery occlusion","Retinal vein occlusion,","Risk Assessment","Risk Factors"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-2B6AE4BB21B61ABC3F98E42A56385C5B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/280371896/Risk_of_Incident_atrial_fibrillation.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/141828661/Risk_of_incident_atrial_fibrillation_in_patients_presenting_with_retinal_artery_or_vein_occlusion.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/214340323/document.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12872-018-0825-1","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Gentofte Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of