{"abstract":"This paper presents CityMockUp, our contribution to the CHI'15 student design competition. CityMockUp emphasizes and proposes a solution to the problem of involving citizens in the actual process of furnishing or shaping the urban environment that they inhabit. The design consists of digitally interconnected and tangible wooden modules that enable the citizens to construct their own desired urban architecture proposals. The product is rooted within and contributes to the emerging field of Urban Interaction Design (UIxD).","author_count":2,"contributors":["Frich Pedersen, Jonas","Søndergaard, Marie Louise Juul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-232843"],"event":{"end":"2015-04-23","place":"Seoul, kr","start":"2015-04-18","title":"33rd Annual CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems, CHI EA 2015","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Design process","Smart cities","Urban Interaction Design"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"citymockup co creating the urban space","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84954213820","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-232843","identifier":[{"id":"84954213820","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-b57779f7-a8ed-4d2a-a337-caadf8d1eeb0"],"keyword":["Design process","Smart cities","Urban interaction design"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A1A91E78E35A91C6C183A5A29324FBF9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Digital design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jonas","key":"frichpedersenpau","last":"Frich Pedersen","locid":"1f394a37-c0c2-40b9-b2b5-45e5021746c1","name":"Frich Pedersen, Jonas","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marie Louise Juul","key":"søndergaardpau","last":"Søndergaard","locid":"0f82f2cf-b8ba-4657-a86b-bc2be36a8113","name":"Søndergaard, Marie Louise Juul","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2702613.2726957","isbn":["9781450331463"],"pages":"43-48","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","subtitle":"Proceedings of the 33rd Annual ACM Conference Extended Abstracts on Human Factors in Computing","title":"CHI EA '15"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84954213820"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-b57779f7-a8ed-4d2a-a337-caadf8d1eeb0"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"CityMockUp : Co-creating the urban space","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-232843","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Severe knee injuries can occur due to biomechanical factors such as knee joint laxity. Generalised Joint Hypermobility (GJH) has been proposed as an intrinsic risk factor for knee injuries in adults and adolescents, as individuals with GJH often have knee joint hypermobility. Also, critical knee injuries are known to be associated with an increased risk for future development of osteoarthritis (OA).","author_count":5,"contributors":["Junge, Tina","Juul-Kristensen, Birgit","Thorlund, Jonas Bloch","Søgaard, Karen","Wedderkopp, Niels"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-591713"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"neuromuscular knee joint control in adolescents with and without generalised joint hypermobility during landing in the single leg hop for distance test","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-591713","ids":["sdu-407a9009-b663-4699-ba51-f2270c4e0e98"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-37E6669AD95D5EB687651F0F7A4AE805"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Lillebælt Hospital","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, Spine Center of Southern Denmark","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics, RICH - Research In Childhood Health"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tina","key":"jungepau","last":"Junge","locid":"cfc44ba3-52fb-4ee1-80aa-37d81f46d477","name":"Junge, Tina","orcid":"0000-0002-3304-3010","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"B","key":"juulkristensenpau","last":"Juul-Kristensen","locid":"887ddfe7-cfa6-4b72-a17d-ecf86987c5c0","name":"Juul-Kristensen, Birgit","name_org":"Juul-Kristensen, B","orcid":"0000-0002-4973-8415","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jonas Bloch","key":"thorlundpau","last":"Thorlund","locid":"5b59bfe4-8aff-41d8-8b2d-4b19ab3e56c4","name":"Thorlund, Jonas Bloch","orcid":"0000-0001-7789-8224","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"K","key":"søgaardpau","last":"Søgaard","locid":"01571423-fcd0-4dbc-9112-e9b52d4a1131","name":"Søgaard, Karen","name_org":"Søgaard, K","orcid":"0000-0003-3968-6364","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"N","key":"wedderkopppau","last":"Wedderkopp","locid":"bcfae344-0a75-458d-8ba2-4198ee915d40","name":"Wedderkopp, Niels","name_org":"Wedderkopp, N","orcid":"0000-0002-9660-6618","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-407a9009-b663-4699-ba51-f2270c4e0e98"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Neuromuscular knee joint control in adolescents with and without Generalised Joint Hypermobility during landing in the Single leg Hop for Distance test.","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-591713","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
