{"abstract":"Severe knee injuries can occur due to biomechanical factors such as knee joint laxity. Generalised Joint Hypermobility (GJH) has been proposed as an intrinsic risk factor for knee injuries in adults and adolescents, as individuals with GJH often have knee joint hypermobility. Also, critical knee injuries are known to be associated with an increased risk for future development of osteoarthritis (OA).","author_count":5,"contributors":["Junge, Tina","Juul-Kristensen, B","Bloch Thorlund, Jonas","Søgaard, Karen","Wedderkopp, Niels"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-648421"],"event":{"end":"2015-01-01","place":"Kolding, dk","start":"2015-01-01","title":"Sports Medicine Congres","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"neuromuscular knee joint control in adolescents with and without generalised joint hypermobility during landing in the single leg hop for distance test","src":["ucl"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCL"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-648421","ids":["ucl-8c423dbb-3d9f-41d7-baaf-327e4a50bd4f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-FA5F25385068CB139F1C2F27A4205762"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucl university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCL","l3nl":"UCL University College","l3nn":"UCL University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCL University College","namevar":["UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Direktion, Sundhed, Anvendt Sundhedsforskning","UCL Erhvervsakademi og Professionshøjskole, Direktion, Sundhed, Fysioterapeutuddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCL","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["University of Southern Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tina","key":"jungepau","last":"Junge","locid":"248f2025-f601-4572-adb6-13dc9a92b598","name":"Junge, Tina","orcid":"0000-0002-3304-3010","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"B","key":"juulkristensenpau","last":"Juul-Kristensen","name":"Juul-Kristensen, B","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"blochthorlundpau","last":"Bloch Thorlund","name":"Bloch Thorlund, Jonas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen","key":"søgaardpau","last":"Søgaard","name":"Søgaard, Karen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels","key":"wedderkopppau","last":"Wedderkopp","name":"Wedderkopp, Niels","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","UCL University College","Universities","University Colleges","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucl-8c423dbb-3d9f-41d7-baaf-327e4a50bd4f"],"src":["UCL University College"],"title":"Neuromuscular knee joint control in adolescents with and without Generalised Joint Hypermobility during landing in the Single leg Hop for Distance test.","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-648421","year":"2014","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Evalueringsmateriale til matematikundervisningen i grundskolen. Dynamat som er et evalueringsmateriale, som er målrettet 4. og 7. klasses elever i matematik. Materialet tester på elevernes matematiske kompetencer (kompetenceblomsten - oprindeligt 8 matematiske kompetencer. I dag har man i Fælles mål for matematik 6 matematiske kompetencer). Der er til materialet en lærevejledning, som understøtter lærerens arbejde med at vurdere elevens matematiske kompetenceniveau og hvordan man kan arbejde med eleven fremadrettet. Dynamat blev udviklet i samarbejde med Nancy Fuglsang, Michael Wahl Andersen og Jesper Hviid Andersen","author_count":1,"contributors":["Hansen, Jonas Juul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-689225"],"filters":{"added":"2023-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Evaluering","Læring pædagogik og undervisning","Matematik","Matematik undervisning"],"level":"edu","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dynamat","src":["kp"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP"],"type":"doo","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-689225","ids":["kp-d11ab488-9461-4a65-9041-eeb16adafd08"],"keyword":["Evaluering","Læring, pædagogik og undervisning","Matematik","Matematik undervisning"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Educational","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-ED1075B480122193814C7F961E23A0D9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for læreruddannelse og livslang læring - Dekan, CFU Vejledning og formidling"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":